# Bandit's Talent: "When this Class enters, each opponent discards two cards unless they discard a nonland card." Bot2
# holds Lightning Bolt and six Islands; it chooses the one-card discard (CR 608.2d), and that card must be a nonland
# card: the Island is refused (beside the Bolt it takes). One card leaves, six remain.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Bandit's Talent
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bandit's Talent.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Discard a nonland card)
! Bot2.Choose(Island)
Bot2.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Bandit's Talent
